gokb is derived from lib/pq (https://github.com/lib/pq), which is
distributed under the MIT license below. The KingbaseES-specific modifications
are distributed by Kingbase (人大金仓) via the official driver download at
https://www.kingbase.com.cn/download.html#drive.

Upstream snapshot: v8r6_golang.zip (KingbaseES V008R006 Go driver),
module path kingbase.com/gokb. The go.mod dependency block (golang-sql/civil,
shopspring/decimal) was completed by the faucet project because the zip's
go.mod omitted the packages its source imports.

